"""Private, provenance-first score/tab extraction for Amazing Tablature.

The extractor never reads a sealed-test manifest.  It operates only on the
explicit discovery or validation work queues, writes beneath the ignored Lane
20 private root, and keeps uncertain recognition as review work instead of
turning guesses into training facts.
"""

